next to each other at red lights

00:00:32.098 --> 00:00:33.299
with tears in their eyes like --
[sniffles]

00:00:33.299 --> 00:00:36.235
"Adele, yeah. I'm --
It's -- It's fantastic."

00:00:36.235 --> 00:00:39.439
In the music video, Adele is
driving a car in black and white

00:00:39.439 --> 00:00:41.473
singing about the past,

00:00:41.473 --> 00:00:43.142
