in the back seat is like,

00:00:43.142 --> 00:00:44.544
"Uh, you can
just let me out here.

00:00:44.544 --> 00:00:47.279
Uh, I'm good."
[ Laughter ]

00:00:47.279 --> 00:00:48.647
"You want to hear my new band?"

00:00:48.647 --> 00:00:49.782
"Not really. We're..."

00:00:49.782 --> 00:00:51.217
Okay, sure.

00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:53.887
